# ╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║                                                                        ║
# ║   ONLY THING YOU NEED TO DO:                                           ║
# ║                                                                        ║
# ║   1) Reset your Supabase database password to PLAIN ALPHANUMERIC.      ║
# ║      (only a-z, A-Z, 0-9, hyphens, underscores — no @ # / ? : etc.)    ║
# ║      Supabase → ⚙ Project Settings → Database → Reset password.        ║
# ║                                                                        ║
# ║   2) Copy the "Transaction pooler" URI                                 ║
# ║      Supabase → ⚙ Project Settings → Database → Connection string      ║
# ║      → URI tab → mode: "Transaction pooler" → Copy.                    ║
# ║                                                                        ║
# ║   3) Paste the entire URI on the DATABASE_URL line below, replacing    ║
# ║      the placeholder. Replace [YOUR-PASSWORD] in the URI with the new  ║
# ║      password text (no brackets, no quotes).                           ║
# ║                                                                        ║
# ╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

# Format will be:
